{
    "title": "Bebi: Baby Games for 2-4y kids",
    "description": "Empower your <b>preschool toddler</b> to learn and have fun playing <b>500+ educational games</b>, from <font color=\"blue\">drawing, coloring and phonics to math, shapes and music</font>.  With Baby Games for Preschool by Bebi, you can support and encourage your toddler to learn unsupervised while having a fun in a <b>100% ad free</b>, safe environment. \r\n\r\nBaby Games for Preschool keeps your toddler occupied and away from video streaming apps by offering 500+ different <b>educational activities, puzzles</b> and <b>games</b>.  It\u2019s free to install, so why not download today and start enriching your toddler\u2019s education?\r\n\r\nWhat can 2,3,4 or even 5 year olds learn? \r\n\r\n\u25baThe alphabet, phonics, numbers, words, tracing, shapes, patterns and colors\r\n\u25ba Basic math and science through games and activities\r\n\u25ba How to recognise and look after animals\r\n\u25ba All about food and healthy eating \r\n\u25ba Music, instruments and singing \r\n\u25ba Art skills through coloring, drawing and doodling \r\n\u25ba Problem solving, dexterity and much, much more\u2026\r\n\r\nFor Pre-K kids, play is an integral part of their development. Toddlers enjoy playing  casual games, but Baby Games for Preschool encourages them to learn and absorb valuable information through interactivity and fun. \r\n\r\nSimilarly, learning from books and papers is not easy at a kindergarten or preschool age. Let your toddler relax with fun and educational games: their absorbent brain will soak up all the new knowledge on its own, allowing you as a parent to relax safe in the knowledge that their screen time is positive and rewarding. Once you notice that your toddler is engaged playing our educational games, you will see that the learning process has begun. \r\n\r\nWhether its popping balloons, discovering science, developing the inner artist or simply learning songs through music, you might even find yourself enjoying a few of the app\u2019s games and activities. \r\n\r\nWhy Baby Games for Preschool? \r\n\u25ba Our 500+ learning games provide a safe and useful device experience for your 2-4 year old toddler\r\n\u25ba Developed and tested by child development experts\r\n\u25ba Designed for safety and convenience with no supervision needed\r\n\u25ba Parental Gate - code protected sections so that your child doesn\u2019t accidentally change settings or make unwanted purchases\r\n\u25ba All settings and outbound links are protected and only accessible for adults\r\n\u25ba Available offline and playable without an internet connection\r\n\u25ba Timely hints so your child doesn't feel frustrated or lost in the app\r\n\u25ba 100 % Ad free with no annoying interruptions\r\n\r\nWho says learning can't be fun? \r\nPlease support us by writing reviews if you like the app and let us know about any issue or suggestions too.\r\n\r\nThis toddler games app has dozens of free games without ads",
    "descriptionHTML": "Empower your <b>preschool toddler</b> to learn and have fun playing <b>500+ educational games</b>, from <font color=\"blue\">drawing, coloring and phonics to math, shapes and music</font>.  With Baby Games for Preschool by Bebi, you can support and encourage your toddler to learn unsupervised while having a fun in a <b>100% ad free</b>, safe environment. <br><br>Baby Games for Preschool keeps your toddler occupied and away from video streaming apps by offering 500+ different <b>educational activities, puzzles</b> and <b>games</b>.  It\u2019s free to install, so why not download today and start enriching your toddler\u2019s education?<br><br>What can 2,3,4 or even 5 year olds learn? <br><br>\u25baThe alphabet, phonics, numbers, words, tracing, shapes, patterns and colors<br>\u25ba Basic math and science through games and activities<br>\u25ba How to recognise and look after animals<br>\u25ba All about food and healthy eating <br>\u25ba Music, instruments and singing <br>\u25ba Art skills through coloring, drawing and doodling <br>\u25ba Problem solving, dexterity and much, much more\u2026<br><br>For Pre-K kids, play is an integral part of their development. Toddlers enjoy playing  casual games, but Baby Games for Preschool encourages them to learn and absorb valuable information through interactivity and fun. <br><br>Similarly, learning from books and papers is not easy at a kindergarten or preschool age. Let your toddler relax with fun and educational games: their absorbent brain will soak up all the new knowledge on its own, allowing you as a parent to relax safe in the knowledge that their screen time is positive and rewarding. Once you notice that your toddler is engaged playing our educational games, you will see that the learning process has begun. <br><br>Whether its popping balloons, discovering science, developing the inner artist or simply learning songs through music, you might even find yourself enjoying a few of the app\u2019s games and activities. <br><br>Why Baby Games for Preschool? <br>\u25ba Our 500+ learning games provide a safe and useful device experience for your 2-4 year old toddler<br>\u25ba Developed and tested by child development experts<br>\u25ba Designed for safety and convenience with no supervision needed<br>\u25ba Parental Gate - code protected sections so that your child doesn\u2019t accidentally change settings or make unwanted purchases<br>\u25ba All settings and outbound links are protected and only accessible for adults<br>\u25ba Available offline and playable without an internet connection<br>\u25ba Timely hints so your child doesn&#39;t feel frustrated or lost in the app<br>\u25ba 100 % Ad free with no annoying interruptions<br><br>Who says learning can&#39;t be fun? <br>Please support us by writing reviews if you like the app and let us know about any issue or suggestions too.<br><br>This toddler games app has dozens of free games without ads",
